!!! BANNER (added 2026-07-29, journal/0122 — the body below is the dated record and is unedited)
!!! The D2 arm's NULL WAS READ WRONG. corrections #72: the hillslope pass IS past a stability
!!! limit — an explicit 4-neighbour Laplacian stops flipping its grid-scale mode only below a
!!! per-edge coefficient of 1/8, and this world's peak effective coefficient is 0.261 shipped
!!! and 12.60 calibrated (2.1x and 100.8x past it). The 4x refinement recorded below left the
!!! calibrated arm 25.2x past the bound, so its null was a statement about the number 4.
!!! Every measurement here stands; the inference drawn from D2 does not. The operator was
!!! fixed 2026-07-29 (Erosion::diffuse sub-cycles to CREEP_MAX_EDGE_COEFF); the world's
!!! after-numbers are in journal/0122 and examples/creep_operator_probe.rs.

